{
  "info": {
    "name": "Order live demo (postman 2)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "AI Assistance Disclosure: ChatGPT (Codex), 2026-10-23. Format conversion only; teammate requests/assertions retained. Human review pending. See order-service/postman 2/WEB-IMPORT.md and order-service/usage-log.md. No live execution claimed. Separate environments and manual stop/start pauses required."
